*.pyc
__pycache__/
runs/*
!runs/.gitkeep
state.json
.agents/**/.brain/
.agents/**/MEMORY.md
node_modules/
.turbo/
**/.turbo/
# approval tokens are ephemeral human-minted artifacts; the consumed ledger is
# local audit — none of it belongs in git
orchestrator/governance/approvals/
# GenesisBlockDB knowledge store — runtime WAL + peer identity (store/knowledge.mjs
# ingest populates it); a local rebuildable cache, never source. The glob also covers
# reversible reset backups (.knowledge.bak-*), since the governance guard blocks rm -rf.
.knowledge*
# Local session-affinity state; contains scheduling metadata only and is rebuildable.
store/.session-leases.json
# External skill-distribution checkout; the harness records its immutable source in
# adapters/host-skills/registry.json and must not track a nested checkout.
/RWANG-PROMAX-skills/
